    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are delighted to present this superb two-bedroom, two-bathroom mid-terrace family home to the market, ideally situated in the popular Allendale Elms development, Clonsilla, Dublin 15.\nThe property enjoys a great location with a host of local amenities close by. There is an excellent selection of schools and shops within easy reach, while the surrounding area offers excellent transport links and convenient access to all that Dublin 15 has to offer.\nBright and well-proportioned internal accommodation extending to approximately c. 89 sq.m briefly comprises entrance hallway, living room, kitchen/dining area, two bedrooms and two bathrooms.\nA particular highlight of this property is the clever attic conversion, which provides an additional room and is accessed via its own staircase. This offers excellent flexibility and could be ideal for a bedroom, home office, hobby room or additional storage, subject to the necessary planning requirements.\nExternally, the property boasts a spacious rear garden offering excellent potential for outdoor entertaining, family use or further enhancement. With a generous footprint, clever attic conversion and excellent location, No. 8 offers massive potential for a new owner to put their own stamp on the property.\nThe property benefits from gas fired central heating and is being offered to the market with no onward chain, making it an attractive opportunity for first-time buyers, families and those looking for a property with scope to add value. Early viewing is strongly advised.\n\nFeatures:\n• 2 Bed / 2 Bath Mid-Terrace\n• C. 89 sq.m\n• BER C Rated\n• No onward chain\n• Additional attic room with own staircase\n• Spacious rear garden\n• Massive potential\n• Gas fired central heating\n• Excellent location\n• Close to schools and shops\n• Ideal first-time buyer opportunity\n• Excellent potential to add value\n• Early viewing strongly advised"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Negotiator",
        "SortOrder": 10,
        "Content": "Sales Team 12"
      }
    ],
